<task id="125" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>H4: SecretClient family port + ARM.AppService KeyVaultReferenceIdentity PATCH (T1) both slots + ARM.Authorization role assignment (T5)</title>
    <phase>C'' Wave G-2 -- Entry + resources</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>H4 is THE CORRECTNESS GATE per DS-4 -- gates H3-&gt;{H8,H9} and every downstream KV consumer (H6/H7/H14 secret reads). T1+T5 trap-owning handler. FULL rigor, highest-priority in Wave G-2.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Named in the task instructions' xhigh-effort exception list ('complex brownfield -- H4 real-values migration') is task 126; THIS task (125) is the mechanical SDK-port half (SecretClient + ARM.AppService + ARM.Authorization, ~350-500 LOC per DS-4) -- Sonnet @ high, task 126 carries the xhigh brownfield weight.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>102, 103, 123</deps>
